@OrdersApi.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

### Health
GET {{OrdersApi.Api_HostAddress}}/health

### Register
POST {{OrdersApi.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "new.user@example.com",
  "name": "New User",
  "password": "Secret123!"
}

### Login (admin)
POST {{OrdersApi.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

### Products
GET {{OrdersApi.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products?page=1&pageSize=10

### Create order (paste token from login)
POST {{OrdersApi.Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "items": [
    { "productId": 1, "quantity": 2 }
  ]
}

### My orders
GET {{OrdersApi.Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders/my
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
